<title>USA: D&amp;N Financial Corp Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>D&amp;N Financial Corp Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p> FOR QUARTER ENDED:	     3/31/97     12/31/96 3/31/96(2)</p>
<p> Net interest income		$11,335    $11,299     $9,682</p>
<p> Net income			     3,294	3,231	3,488</p>
<p>Earnings per share:</p>
<p>  Primary				  0.38	 0.39	 0.43</p>
<p>  Fully diluted			  0.38	 0.39	 0.42</p>
<p>NOTE: Common shares outstanding was 8,315,821 at March 31, 1997; 8,348,155 at December 31, 1996; and 7,529,027 at March 31, 1996. Certain amounts reclassified to conform with current period presentation.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
